I left out the `http-client` import. The node's `with` clause grants only `kb-read` and `tool-llm`, and the graph definition hasn't been updated to add `http-client`. The change would also send customer question text to an external host, so it can't be handled as a silent node-body change. Once the grant is in the graph, the import can be added. The files below implement the node as specified.

